OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 9 DEC
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GJoshua Weilserstein and the BBC
OL,6,     GPhilharmonic with Debussy's La
OL,7,     GMer live from Salford, music from
OL,8,     Gour New Generation Artists, and
OL,9,     GImmo Yang plays Prokofiev's 1st
OL,10,     GViolin Concerto.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: A Medieval
OL,12,     FChristmas
OL,13,     GDonald Macleod investigates some
OL,14,     Gunusual festive celebrations
OL,15,     Gpopular in the Middle Ages.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GPetroc Trelawny welcomes jazz
OL,18,     Gsinger Richard Shelton to perform
OL,19,     Ga festive set of music with his
OL,20,     GQuartet. Conductor Ellie Slorach
OL,21,     Gis also live ion the studio.
