OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 9 DEC
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,8,     GIn a special concert marking his
OL,9,     G85th birthday, American pianist
OL,10,     GStephen Kovacevich is joined by
OL,11,     GMartha Argerich and the violinist
OL,12,     GIrene Duval.
OL,13,G2145FThe Essay: Scotland in Song
OL,14,     GMusic knows many different forms
OL,15,     Gin Scotland, as a result of her
OL,16,     Gradically different traditions.
OL,17,     GPoet Kenneth Steven chooses to
OL,18,     Gexplore the stories of five
OL,19,     Gcomposers.
